Capture a share-safe wrong_answer_report.v1 bundle from a query

Usage:
  eshu report capture [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key string       API key for authentication
      --endpoint string      API path to query (required)
  -h, --help                 help for capture
      --include-payloads     PRIVATE TRIAGE ONLY: attach raw fact payloads and citation excerpts (never attach to a public issue)
      --method string        HTTP method to issue: GET or POST (default "GET")
      --note string          What you expected instead of the captured answer
      --out string           Path to write the report bundle JSON; stdout when omitted
      --params string        JSON object of query/body parameters as issued
      --profile string       Config profile name
      --service-url string   API service URL (overrides config)
      --tool string          MCP tool name this query originated from, recorded as the surface; --endpoint still resolves the answer (Slice 1 records MCP capture, it does not invoke MCP itself)

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
